{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowfects</strong> is a tool designed to help you boost productivity, stay focused, and unwind after a long day. Whether you\u2019re looking to organize your work, spark creativity, or simply relax, Flowfects creates an environment that adapts to your needs and mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/3cef5033836bcbad13b5ac4be722e16e.poster.avif?t=1774774696\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/3cef5033836bcbad13b5ac4be722e16e.webm?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/3cef5033836bcbad13b5ac4be722e16e.mp4?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its simple yet powerful interface lets you switch seamlessly between focus and relaxation. Use it to stay on task, meditate, experiment with visual effects, or just enjoy a moment of calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/dfa39597b9f61a1857062b1dba6d78fc.poster.avif?t=1774774696\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/dfa39597b9f61a1857062b1dba6d78fc.webm?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/dfa39597b9f61a1857062b1dba6d78fc.mp4?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowfects combines practical productivity tools with creative and sensory features, offering an experience that\u2019s both functional and soothing. It\u2019s designed for flexibility - you decide how to use it: as a productivity companion, a relaxation space, or a mix of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/b6e3ee1244ad18645af4dce756bedc14.poster.avif?t=1774774696\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/b6e3ee1244ad18645af4dce756bedc14.webm?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/b6e3ee1244ad18645af4dce756bedc14.mp4?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app has received positive feedback from a wide range of users, including people on the autism spectrum, who appreciate its calming visuals, structured timers, and customizable environment. While not designed as a therapeutic tool, many have found it supportive for focus and relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/c45e00c0c6619b03f1e47ca45ca90ba7.poster.avif?t=1774774696\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/c45e00c0c6619b03f1e47ca45ca90ba7.webm?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/c45e00c0c6619b03f1e47ca45ca90ba7.mp4?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ effects</strong> to play and relax (each one has options to customize their behavior)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> with adjustable duration and break duration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task list</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Task timer</strong> which can calculate daily time and week time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music player</strong> with music from all released SmallBigSquare games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable window size and window masks</strong>, allowing you to work with the app in the corner or in any suitable place</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/046c6ead924aa7d9baf1e791af327368.poster.avif?t=1774774696\" width=1170 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/046c6ead924aa7d9baf1e791af327368.webm?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124610/extras/046c6ead924aa7d9baf1e791af327368.mp4?t=1774774696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why try it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowfects is more than just another timer - it\u2019s a space for focus, creativity, and calm. By combining productivity tools with immersive visuals and sound, it helps you stay balanced, motivated, and relaxed - all in one intuitive app.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124610?t=1774774696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps